ère","intro":"Toute la gourmandise de la tartiflette, en plus léger pour la semaine.","minutes":55,"calories":520,"difficulty":"Facile","imageSearch":"light tartiflette potato","veg":false,"oven":true,"cold":false,"missing":"","origin":"Spécialité savoyarde","serves":4,"items":[{"name":"pomme de terre","plural":"pommes de terre","qty":1000,"unit":"g","have":false},{"name":"reblochon","plural":"reblochons","qty":1,"unit":"","have":false},{"name":"dés de jambon","plural":"dés de jambon","qty":150,"unit":"g","have":false},{"name":"oignon","plural":"oignons","qty":2,"unit":"","have":false},{"name":"fromage blanc","plural":"fromages blanc","qty":200,"unit":"g","have":false},{"name":"sel","plural":"sels","qty":null,"unit":"","have":false},{"name":"poivre","plural":"poivres","qty":null,"unit":"","have":false}],"steps":[{"text":"Fais cuire les pommes de terre 20 min dans l'eau bouillante salée.","timer":{"label":"Cuisson","min":20}},{"text":"Préchauffe le four à 200 °C. Coupe les pommes de terre en rondelles.","timer":null},{"text":"Fais revenir les oignons émincés 5 min à la poêle avec le jambon.","timer":{"label":"Poêle","min":5}},{"text":"Mélange le fromage blanc avec du sel et du poivre, puis avec les pommes de terre, l'oignon et le jambon.","timer":null},{"text":"Verse dans un plat, ajoute un demi-reblochon en tranches et enfourne 25 min.","timer":{"label":"Four","min":25}}]},{"title":"Pâtes aux champignons et au jambon","intro":"Le classique crémeux, avec du jambon en plus.","minutes":20,"calories":620,"difficulty":"Facile","imageSearch":"pasta ham mushroom cream","veg":false,"oven":false,"cold":false,"missing":"","origin":"","serves":4,"items":[{"name":"pâtes","plural":"pâtes","qty":400,"unit":"g","have":false},{"name":"champignon de Paris","plural":"champignons de Paris","qty":250,"unit":"g","have":false},{"name":"dés de jambon","plural":"dés de jambon","qty":150,"unit":"g","have":false},{"name":"crème fraîche","plural":"crèmes fraîche","qty":20,"unit":"cl","have":f